Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.74,0:00:05.18,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.18,0:00:06.44,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.44,0:00:08.16,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.70,0:00:11.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.55,0:00:14.28,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, please say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.49,0:00:15.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.84,0:00:18.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.16,0:02:24.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Haru-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.63,0:02:29.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.15,0:02:37.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.24,0:02:42.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I know I shouldn't cry, but... {Wolfy- I shouldn't cry, but...}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.65,0:02:46.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's hard to endure...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.03,0:02:48.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Because it's Haru-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.64,0:02:52.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.30,0:02:59.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. I shouldn't keep on crying. {I shouldn't keep on crying. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.20,0:03:03.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You know, Sumomo-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.76,0:03:07.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone has something that they like or treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.63,0:03:08.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.97,0:03:13.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And for everyone, there is something they must do everyday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.52,0:03:15.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,For me, it's work...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.50,0:03:18.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And for Sumomo-chan and Nako-chan, it's school.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.26,0:03:19.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.16,0:03:21.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.23,0:03:24.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes, there are times where you throw away everything, {Sometimes, there are times where you simply throw away everything... - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.54,0:03:27.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,and protect the thing that is important to you. {In order to protect someone who is important to you. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.65,0:03:29.11,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.61,0:03:34.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,When that happens even if you cry or scream... {When that happens, crying or screaming... - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.84,0:03:37.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,it is nothing to be ashamed of.{/ Is not a bad thing to do.} {Comment: I feel that the first one sounds better. - megu} {wolfy- I think the first one is better too}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.45,0:03:38.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.17,0:03:45.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.95,0:03:49.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Nako-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.33,0:03:52.83,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You don't need to push yourself, Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.87,0:03:55.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Nako-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.98,0:04:02.19,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun... Haru-kun did it for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.27,0:04:05.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.46,0:04:24.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And for that reason, Tsuwabuki-kun was hospitalized at the local hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.65,0:04:26.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki hospitalized?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.51,0:04:28.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Leave of absence, they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.71,0:04:29.92,Nanatsuiro[Default2],,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't he going out with Akihime? {Wasn't he going out with Akihime? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.92,0:04:30.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.88,0:04:36.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well, even though I say hospitalization, he is just getting rest so there is no need to worry. {Well, since he's being hospitalized, he is surely resting so there's no need to worry, I think. - megu} {wolfy- Well, even is he's hospitalized, he is just getting some rest so I there is no need to worry.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.17,0:04:40.22,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well then...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.52,0:04:43.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.77,0:04:45.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo-chan went to visit, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.57,0:04:47.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki, how was he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.08,0:04:50.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,He was fine a few days ago, wasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.57,0:04:51.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Just what kind of illness...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.97,0:04:55.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Truthfully, it wasn't something that even needed visiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.53,0:04:57.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Right, Sumomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.08,0:04:57.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:04:59.91,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.91,0:05:02.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo-chan, you must be worrying a lot.{You must be worrying a lot, Sumomo-chan.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.10,0:05:03.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.33,0:05:05.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Why did he suddenly...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.38,0:05:07.83,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.83,0:05:10.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun will come back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.14,0:05:16.22,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure that... pretty soon...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.22,0:05:17.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.69,0:05:31.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Even though it's my fault,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.56,0:05:32.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}why...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.74,0:05:34.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.16,0:05:40.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.93,0:05:46.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo doesn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.19,0:05:51.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No, she doesn't blame Yuuki at the slightest. {(request TL check)}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.22,0:05:54.43,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Therefore...{That...}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.02,0:05:58.34,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Therefore, you don't need to be so hard on yourself.{Therefore, you don't need to scold yourself that much.} {You don't need to be so hard on yourself. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.56,0:06:40.43,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This Recipe is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.22,0:06:42.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Could it be...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.94,0:06:45.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Impossible. It's too difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.89,0:06:48.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo-chan can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.17,0:06:54.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.62,0:07:08.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You've cleaned much better today than before.{You cleaned better then before today.} {You cleaned today better than before.  - megu} {wolfy- You've cleaned much better than before}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.75,0:07:10.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Matsuda.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.08,0:07:14.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No, what I did was something a butler should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.41,0:07:17.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for doing this for me, Matsuda.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.79,0:07:19.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It is an honor!{I think Matsuda's mother dropped him on his head few times too much...}{Aiko: I second that...}{Comment: Butlers, butlers... is it me or have I seen another series with a butler that is willing to do anything for his bratty girl/master? Hint: The butler has a 1.56 Million Yen debt.- megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.23,0:07:23.69,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss, Matsuda is working very hard-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.30,0:07:26.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.02,0:07:28.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What seems to be the problem? {wolfy- What seems to be the problem.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.74,0:07:30.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,To return this early...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.82,0:07:34.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,If you'd have called, I would've gone straight away to pick you up. {wolfy- If you had called, I would've gone straight away to pick you up. (Note the change of tense)}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.09,0:07:37.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But more importantly, are you feeling sick or something?{But more importantly, is there any sickness or illness you have?}{check} {But more importantly, are your feeling sick or anything? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.92,0:07:39.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Should I bring some medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.58,0:07:41.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Or maybe something war-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.93,0:07:45.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,M-Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.86,0:07:47.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What happened, Miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.87,0:07:49.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.28,0:07:52.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun will come back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.53,0:07:56.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure that... pretty soon...{I'm sure, that pretty soon...}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.35,0:07:57.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure...{Surely.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.07,0:08:00.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's my fault, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.75,0:08:03.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's natural that I should take the blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.07,0:08:10.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Why? Why aren't you even blaming me at all? {WhY? Why aren't you even blaming me at all? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.55,0:08:15.72,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So, Sumomo-chan...{Sumomo-chan really,}{Sumomo-chan... - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.72,0:08:20.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You said you were able to use the Recipe called "Timu Forna Mei," right? {was really able to use the spell called "Tim Forna May", is that right? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.47,0:08:21.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.64,0:08:26.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It was like things around me slowed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.97,0:08:30.41,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well, there is a more advanced Recipe. {Righ. There's a more advanced recipe. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.41,0:08:34.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,If you can use a Recipe called "Tim Forna Principatu,"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:38.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,you might be able to turn back Yuki's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.60,0:08:42.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And if you return to the time before he revealed his identity,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.30,0:08:45.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun might be able to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.73,0:08:47.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Is that true?{Is it true?/Really?} {wolfy- Is that true?}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.38,0:08:48.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But this...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.07,0:08:54.11,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This is a very difficult Recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.11,0:08:56.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not sure how well it will go.{Up to what point it will go well...}{I'm not sure how well it may go. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.79,0:08:58.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.19,0:09:02.18,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sensei, I'll... I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.18,0:09:05.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No matter how difficult it may be...{No matter how difficult./Even though, how difficult it may be.}{wolfy- No matter how difficult it is.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.48,0:09:07.91,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't do it, Haru-kun will...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.79,0:09:11.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun will...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.34,0:09:25.83,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, for Figurare's power to be at its fullest...{Well then, for Figurare's power to be exhibited strongly.}{Well then, for Figurare's power to be at its fullest... - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.79,0:09:29.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.42,0:09:33.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Let's do it when the moon is full.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.92,0:09:43.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Sumomo doesn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.10,0:09:48.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No, she doesn't blame Yuuki at the slightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.85,0:09:54.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss, I brought some hot tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.55,0:09:55.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.50,0:09:57.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.87,0:10:00.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you going?{To where are you outing?}{To where are you going? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.17,0:10:58.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That light is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.54,0:11:14.02,Sumomo[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Timu Forna Principatu
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.43,0:11:30.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.26,0:11:32.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You've been practicing this so much. You're tired, aren't you? {wolfy- You've been practicing this so hard, you must be tired?}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.89,0:11:37.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's very difficult to control.{Controlling, is very difficult./It is very hard to control.}{wolfy- The second one sounds good}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:39.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But I want to keep trying a little harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.31,0:11:41.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.58,0:11:48.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Timu Forna Principatu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.06,0:11:51.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.67,0:11:54.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way that it'll work.{There is no chance to succeed/of success.}{There's no chance of success. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.22,0:11:56.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.75,0:12:35.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No matter how much I try, it isn't going well. {It doesn't go well, no matter how much I try.- megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.51,0:12:36.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.80,0:12:41.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's harder than any of the Recipes I've used so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.20,0:12:43.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.61,0:12:47.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}To be that tired... {To be that tired..u - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.75,0:12:51.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's not surprising... for such a difficult Recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.47,0:12:53.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.59,0:12:55.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What seems to be the problem? {wolfy- What seems to be the problem?}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.51,0:12:57.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,To suddenly say that you wish to go to the kitchen... {To suddenly say that you wish to go to the kitchen... - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.66,0:13:01.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And lately, you've been going out alone at night.{/And lately you don't take me with you during outings at night...} {Comment: First one sounds good. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.13,0:13:03.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's not to collect stardrops either, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.84,0:13:06.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! If there is a need for a boxed lunch, I will gladly prepare it.{If there is a need for a boxed lunch I would prepare them.}{if there's a need for a boxed lunch, then I would gladly prepare it. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.76,0:13:08.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Then there's no point!{/It shouldn't be like that!}{Comment: Yuuki's trying to learn how to cook, so... "Then there's not point in doing it!" or something. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.53,0:13:09.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.50,0:13:12.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Matsuda!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.52,0:13:13.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.53,0:13:17.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,C-Cooking, how do you do it? {wolfy- First one}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.85,0:13:23.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}One more night...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.86,0:13:25.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Tonight, without a doubt...{/Surely tonight.}{wolfy- first one sounds good}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.50,0:13:30.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'll control time to make the withered flower blossom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.37,0:13:35.96,Sumomo[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Timu Forna Principatu
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.54,0:13:53.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.31,0:13:55.32,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.32,0:13:56.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing, Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.49,0:13:57.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You made it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.59,0:14:00.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, thanks Nako-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.02,0:14:01.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You've done well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.38,0:14:05.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.80,0:14:09.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm okay. It's just that I'm out of strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.33,0:14:12.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo, to do it up to this point...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:15.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.50,0:14:19.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's because Nako-chan kept encouraging me. {wolfy- It's because Nako-chan kept cheering me on.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.08,0:14:21.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No, Sumomo gave it her best, that's why. {No, Sumomo gave her best, that's why. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.10,0:14:23.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure that everything will go just fine tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.64,0:14:24.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.02,0:14:41.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.52,0:14:42.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.33,0:14:44.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,A-A-Are you okay?{A-a-a-a-are you safe/ok?!}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.51,0:14:46.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Matsuda will take care of this...{This Matsuda will take care of...}{Matsuda will take care of this... - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.45,0:14:48.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine, let's continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.50,0:14:51.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But Miss...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.30,0:15:05.95,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,At last, tonight...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.95,0:15:09.69,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,If I... If I fail...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.27,0:15:12.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's possible, if it is Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.40,0:15:13.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.76,0:15:15.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You can definitely do it, Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.76,0:15:16.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.44,0:15:25.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm scared, Haru-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.50,0:15:34.22,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.05,0:15:36.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.17,0:15:39.11,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.11,0:15:40.34,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.34,0:15:41.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.54,0:15:55.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.51,0:16:00.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.48,0:16:38.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.60,0:16:44.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.05,0:16:53.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my, I fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.76,0:16:58.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:17:00.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.73,0:17:04.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Eat this and do well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.65,0:17:09.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There's no point if you collapse before you save Tsuwabuki, is there? {It would be pointless if you collapsed before you save Tsuwabuki, right? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.79,0:17:12.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuuki Nona.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.29,0:17:15.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Nona-chan. {Nona-chan? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.09,0:17:26.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't eat these past few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.00,0:17:31.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Nona-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.25,0:17:32.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.25,0:17:43.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This is a magic circle which amplifies the power of your spell. {wolfy- This is a magic circle which amplifies the power of your spell.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.68,0:17:45.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Now, Sumomo-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.29,0:17:46.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,put Yuki-chan down in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.99,0:17:48.19,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.03,0:17:53.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.00,0:17:55.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.58,0:17:57.15,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Please wait for me.{/ Please wait.}{wolfy- First one is good}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.49,0:18:09.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be great if the ability of the Ladle could be amplified from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.00,0:18:11.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Now, swinging the Ladle in front of Yuki-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.54,0:18:13.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,and reciting the Recipe is all that's left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.56,0:18:14.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Good luck. {Wolfy- Good luck.}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.65,0:18:15.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.73,0:18:19.95,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Nako-chan, sorry to make you worry all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.95,0:18:21.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure it will go well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.01,0:18:23.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.27,0:18:26.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, good luck to you.{Yep, have strength/Good luck.}{wolfy- Yep, good luck.}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.99,0:18:39.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sensei, Nako-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.86,0:18:42.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And Nona-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.50,0:18:43.72,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.02,0:18:49.22,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.71,0:18:51.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.58,0:18:59.55,Sumomo[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Timu Forna Principatu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:22.91,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:22.91,Nanatsuiro[Default2],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.54,0:19:36.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Pull yourself together, Prima Plam!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.25,0:19:38.91,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You can't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.91,0:19:41.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to meet him, Tsuwabuki, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.89,0:19:46.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Aspalas-san... No. Nona-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.67,0:19:47.95,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.24,0:20:02.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Do your best.{Have strength.}{Aiko: TL check She sounds like she is saying a cross between good luck and keep at it}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.74,0:20:08.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay. It'll definitely work.{It's okay. Definetely it'll go well.}{check} {It'll definitely go well. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.48,0:20:10.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,If it is you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.68,0:20:12.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Have faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.76,0:20:16.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That was...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.17,0:20:18.41,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.11,0:20:19.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.33,0:20:23.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Yuki-chan, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.21,0:20:27.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Haru-kun, come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.08,0:20:41.34,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.67,0:20:44.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine. It definitely was a success. {wolfy- Second one}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.97,0:20:48.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.42,0:20:55.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.03,0:20:59.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.40,0:21:01.15,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.13,0:21:05.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.57,0:21:07.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.70,0:21:10.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, Sumomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.52,0:21:13.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Is this... the school's grounds?{This is, the school's grounds?}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.74,0:21:16.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Eh. Sumomo? Sumomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.25,0:21:20.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,We'll tell you all about it later, Tsuwabuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.27,0:21:22.95,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yaeno, Yuuki too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.93,0:21:31.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry to call you all the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.49,0:21:33.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It wasn't because of me.{It was not my power/strength.}{It wasn't because of my power. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.79,0:21:36.19,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It was because of the strength of those two girls. {It was the power of those two girls. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.19,0:21:39.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Those two are really amazing.{They are really wonderful/amazing childrens/girls.}{Those girls are really amazing. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.63,0:21:44.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sensei, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.69,0:21:48.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's the result of Sumomo-chan's effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.13,0:21:50.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The power of love really is invincible.{The power of love is really invincible.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.89,0:21:52.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.52,0:21:54.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuuki said she'll give us rides!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.73,0:21:59.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go thank Nona-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.75,0:22:00.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well then...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.28,0:22:02.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.20,0:22:04.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.72,0:22:08.95,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll ask just in case, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.95,0:22:10.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.32,0:22:12.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What month is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.65,0:22:15.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, what month you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.44,0:22:23.39,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's May.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.51,0:22:31.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, it's November... Tsuwabuki-kun.{DUN DUN DUN!} {Remember kids, be careful when you fiddle around with the flow of time. :3 - megu} {wolfy- Right now, it's November}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.01,0:24:22.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What if a precious memory disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.36,0:24:23.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.45,0:24:27.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What if two lovers lost their memory of their time together?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.71,0:24:28.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.62,0:24:31.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,If I lost my precious memory of being with Nobuko-san...! {If I lost my precious memory of being with Nobuko-san..!? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.92,0:24:32.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Obviously...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.82,0:24:34.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's not it! Idiot!
